 "nl": [
  "Apart from ntp-servers on HTTPS (TCP 443); admin on syslog (UDP 514), all traffic originating in edge-cache must be dropped.",
  "ntp-servers offers DNS over UDP 53 and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "Deny all traffic from edge-cache to finance (this overrides any public service).",
  "Hosts in printers may reach ntp-servers over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SNMP (UDP 161) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to finance over DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "printers must accept syslog (UDP 514) from ntp-servers.",
  "Hosts in student-lab may reach finance over SMB (TCP 445) and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Deny all traffic from admin to edge-cache (this overrides any public service).",
  "ntp-servers must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from edge-cache.",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to ntp-servers using HTTP (TCP 80) and syslog (UDP 514) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to admin over HTTPS (TCP 443) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Deny all traffic from student-lab to finance (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow ntp-servers to connect to student-lab using SNMP (UDP 161) and RTSP (TCP 554) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "student-lab must accept SMB (TCP 445) from admin."
 ],
